# k.objects/shards/land-3: iceberg, glacier, crater, plateau. Parts with a primitive shape, a box in the 0 to 100 frame of the object (x right, y down), a draw order z and typical colours; points for lines and polygons.
# sources: hand-core 1 (hand-written in this repository: tools/objects-hand-data.mjs)
# license: CC0-1.0
# script: tools/objects-hand.mjs

